'''Hits can't be evaded''' (and its variations) is a modifier that can be found on [[weapon]]s, [[skill]]s and [[passive skill]]s. It makes [[attack]]s ignore attacker's [[accuracy]] and target's [[evasion]], for an effective 100% chance to [[hit]] a target.

Since accuracy and evasion are ignored, a hit that is rolled [[Critical strike|critical]] will not be checked to determine if the critical is evaded or not.<ref name="CritsCantBeEvaded"/> This means that the modifier is strong for critical builds, which are usually suffering a lot from poor accuracy, through the double chances to hit check.

==Sources==
===Skill gems===
{{Query stat related skill gems
|stat_id_query=%always%hit%
}}

===Veil mod===
* [[Vagan, Victory's Herald|Vagan]]'s signature veil mod: {{ml|JunMaster2AlwaysHits1}}

===Unique items===
{{Drop enabled unique item table
|tables=item_stats
|join=items._pageID=item_stats._pageID
|where=item_stats.id LIKE "%always_hit%" OR item_stats.id LIKE "%cannot_be_evaded%"
|large=1
|level=1
|stat=1
}}

==Passive skills==
===Ascendancy passives===
{{Query ascendancy passive skills
|where=
  passive_skill_stats.id LIKE "%cannot%evade%" 
  OR passive_skill_stats.id LIKE "%cant%evade%" 
}}
===Keystones===
{{Query keystone passive skills
|where=
  passive_skills.stat_text LIKE "%cannot%evade%" 
  OR passive_skills.stat_text LIKE "%can't%evade%" 
}}

